BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-yes@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270120
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship yes: you
DESCRIPTION:Brand says yes: send the campaign agreement (legal pack file 1
 0\, Part 1 from the campaign row)\, the invoice (tools/make_invoice.py) an
 d the certificate request (file 11)\, and ask for the allergen sheet\, log
 o\, two card sentences\, discount code or landing page\, the unused-produc
 t election and the newsletter choice. Latest date that still leaves five b
 usiness days to pay before T-10.\nLog: campaigns row (tier\, offices\, ter
 ms)\; invoices row
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-approvals_ask@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270120
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship approvals ask: you
DESCRIPTION:Ask each office on the route about this brand (template 01). A
 n office's first three drops need its explicit yes\; after that\, notice a
 t least five business days ahead and it comes unless they say no.\nLog: ap
 provals rows: asked_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-building_coi@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270120
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship building coi: you
DESCRIPTION:Offices whose building wants our certificate (coi_required yes
  or unsure): request it from our carrier at least 10 business days before 
 that office's first drop (legal pack file 12)\, only once general liabilit
 y is bound.\nLog: offices: building_coi_status\, building_coi_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-paid@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship paid: brand
DESCRIPTION:Payment lands in the business account: log paid_date and paid_
 amount on invoices. Founding: due within five business days of the invoice
  and before shipping\; standard: the first 50% on signing. Five business d
 ays late: you decide whether to cancel and refund (file 10\, section 3).\n
 Log: invoices: paid_date\, paid_amount_usd\, method\, bank_reference
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-coi_check@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship coi check: you
DESCRIPTION:Brand's certificate in: the five-minute check in legal pack fi
 le 11. Tick coi_check_ok on brands. If the policy ends before 12 months af
 ter the window\, diary the renewal certificate.\nLog: campaigns: coi_recei
 ved_date\; brands: coi_check_ok\, coi_policy_end_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-release@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship release: you
DESCRIPTION:When campaigns shows ship_release RELEASED (payment\, agreemen
 t\, certificate\, every office approved)\, send the ship-date email (templ
 ate 02) the same day. Never confirm a ship date on HOLD.\nLog: campaigns: 
 ship_release
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-direct_plan@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship direct plan: you and brand
DESCRIPTION:Direct-ship: send the brand each office's address and case lab
 els (labels.pdf)\, ask for a service that delivers on T\, one tracking num
 ber per office by T-2\, and the reserve shipped to you by T-5.\nLog: stops
 : carrier_tracking later
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-ship@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship ship: brand
DESCRIPTION:Hard ship-by and cancel-by date (T-10). Approvals due. If T-10
  to T-5 crosses 18 to 31 December\, brands were asked to ship earlier (shi
 p_by_requested).\nLog: approvals: reply\, reply_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
