DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270204
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270205
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship kit print: you
DESCRIPTION:Not arrived (founder\, courier) = slip exactly one week (tools
 /opscal.py slip) and tell every office and the brand today (template 12). 
 Otherwise print cards and labels (make_kit.py\; qr-check.txt must say all 
 OK)\, test-scan every card\, and send each office its window and Slack pos
 t (template 03).\nLog: stops: slack_post_sent_date\; costs: kit
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
