UID:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship-confirm@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270209
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship confirm: you
DESCRIPTION:Text each pantry owner to confirm (template 04). Pack one labe
 led case per office per brand against the kit checklist\; bag and label th
 e reserve. Print the route sheet. Charge the phone\, load the hand truck. 
 Read every link's total after your test scans and log it as the baseline.\
 nLog: stops: confirm_text_sent_date\; scans: baseline
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
