DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270224
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270225
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-direct-ship debrief: you and brand
DESCRIPTION:Brand debrief\, 20 minutes (templates/debrief-brand.md)\; send
  the renewal proposal the same day. Export actuals for the financial model
  (export_actuals.py) and set Actuals in = Y there once money\, costs and h
 ours are final.\nLog: campaigns: debrief_date\, brand_would_buy_again\, re
 newed\; hours: reporting_debriefs
